      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual strategy review
Frequency: Annual + event-driven
Volume: All imported categories
Owner: Trade Compliance Manager
Participants: Trade Compliance, Procurement, Finance
Source: workflow W2953 — FTA Preference Strategy &amp; Annual Duty Savings Analysis</bpmn:documentation>
