Responsible (R): Procurement
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2953_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2953_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
