    <bpmn:process id="W_W2954" name="W2954. Certificate of Origin (Form D/RCEP CO) Procurement &amp; Vendor Onboarding" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New vendor or FTA preference claim
Frequency: Event-driven + ongoing
Volume: ~400 import vendors
Owner: Procurement
Participants: Procurement, Trade Compliance, Vendor
Source: workflow W2954 — Certificate of Origin (Form D/RCEP CO) Procurement &amp; Vendor Onboarding</bpmn:documentation>
