Responsible (R): Vendor / Trade Compliance
Accountable (A): Trade Compliance Manager
Duration: Per shipment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2954_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2954_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2954_Task8" name="Trade Compliance archives CO; tracks CO-back ratio (claimable vs. actual)…">
