Responsible (R): DC Operations
Accountable (A): Trade Compliance Specialist
Duration: Weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2956_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2956_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
